{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57186","headline":"十二时颂 六 · 宝志","name":"十二时颂 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日昳未，心地何曾安了义？\n他家文字没亲踈，莫起功夫求的意。\n任纵横，绝忌讳，长在人间不居止。\n运用不离声色中，历劫何曾暂抛弃？\n（《宗镜录》卷十五引此首，「没」作「有」，「居止」作「居世」，「不离」作「元来」，末句作「凡夫不了争爲计」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}